{"id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-infinite-term.md","title":"有限与无穷项的树表示","display":"df-infinite-term — 有限与无穷项的树表示","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-signature]]","[[56-df-variable]]","[[56-df-position]]"],"label":"56-df-infinite-term","aliases":["56-df-infinite-term"],"display":"df-infinite-term — 有限与无穷项的树表示","type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §12.2, printed pp670–671","source_ocr_block":"691–692","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed5ba7b91a54af72\" href=\"?note=ed5ba7b91a54af72\" title=\"56-df-variable\">56-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-infinite-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-infinite-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinite-term — 有限与无穷项的树表示"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §12.2, printed pp670–671"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"691–692"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span> 与变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>，每个函数符号元数为自然数。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(W=\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为有限正整数串集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pq\">\\(pq\\)</span> 表示串连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\preceq q\">\\(p\\preceq q\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a> 中的前缀关系。项用带标签的树表示为偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:W\\rightharpoonup F\\cup\\mathcal V\">\\(t:W\\rightharpoonup F\\cup\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dom}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\)</span> 是其定义域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\bigcup_{D\\subseteq W}(F\\cup\\mathcal V)^D:\\epsilon\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\subseteq W\\land\\mathrm{ran}(t)\\subseteq F\\cup\\mathcal V\\land\\forall p,q\\in W\\;(pq\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\Longrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(pi\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists f\\in F\\;(t(p)=f\\land i\\le\\mathrm{ar}(f)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\bigcup_{D\\subseteq W}(F\\cup\\mathcal V)^D:\\epsilon\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\subseteq W\\land\\mathrm{ran}(t)\\subseteq F\\cup\\mathcal V\\land\\forall p,q\\in W\\;(pq\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\Longrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(pi\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists f\\in F\\;(t(p)=f\\land i\\le\\mathrm{ar}(f)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pos}_\\infty(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{dom}(t),\\qquad\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ran}(t)\\cap\\mathcal V,\\qquad\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V):|\\mathrm{dom}(t)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pos}_\\infty(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{dom}(t),\\qquad\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ran}(t)\\cap\\mathcal V,\\qquad\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V):|\\mathrm{dom}(t)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.2（印刷 pp670–671，OCR 页块691–692）。树非空、前缀封闭，每个函数节点恰有指定数目的孩子，变量没有孩子。有限自由项与有限树通过逐位置取标签自然一一对应，后续在需要时采用这一对应；不把一阶语法树和偏函数编码未经说明地混作同一集合。所有位置均有限，允许无限分支，不加入“无限深度的末端节点”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ed5ba7b91a54af72","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定签名 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$ 与变量集 $\\mathcal V$，每个函数符号元数为自然数。令 $W=\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}$ 为有限正整数串集合，$\\epsilon$ 为空串，$pq$ 表示串连接，$p\\preceq q$ 为 [[56-df-position]] 中的前缀关系。项用带标签的树表示为偏函数 $t:W\\rightharpoonup F\\cup\\mathcal V$；$\\mathrm{dom}(t)$ 是其定义域。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"pq","display":false},{"tex":"p\\preceq q","display":false},{"tex":"t:W\\rightharpoonup F\\cup\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dom}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\bigcup_{D\\subseteq W}(F\\cup\\mathcal V)^D:\\epsilon\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\subseteq W\\land\\mathrm{ran}(t)\\subseteq F\\cup\\mathcal V\\land\\forall p,q\\in W\\;(pq\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\Longrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;(pi\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists f\\in F\\;(t(p)=f\\land i\\le\\mathrm{ar}(f)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pos}_\\infty(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{dom}(t),\\qquad\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ran}(t)\\cap\\mathcal V,\\qquad\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V):|\\mathrm{dom}(t)|<\\aleph_0\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2046,"backlinks":[{"id":"4e0030b331726af9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$、$W=\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}$。令 $T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，取 [[56-df-infinite-term]] 已定义的有限树子集。$s,t,u\\in T^\\infty$；子项与子树替换的参数域是 $p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)$。本节点允许右部无穷、左部有限；$R$ 的每条规则满足断言中的条件。$\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T^\\infty$；$t\\upharpoonright D$ 表示函数限制。下列子项、替换和子树替换均在树编码上定义。"},{"id":"abe5105dc83b1e79","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，见 [[56-df-infinite-term]]。取不在 $F\\cup\\mathcal V$ 中的符号 $\\bot$。$s,t\\in T^\\infty$；$|p|$ 是有限位置串长度。$\\widehat t$ 为以 $\\bot$ 补全树外位置后的全函数。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-infinite-term.md]]"},{"id":"4c072e6a1aee9fc9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$d$ 为 [[56-df-metric-on-terms]] 中首差度量；$T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 取 [[56-df-infinite-term]] 中全部有限项树的集合。变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 非空。$\\mathbf t=(t_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}$，每个序列分量仅在自然数下标处使用；$\\varepsilon$ 遍历正实数。"}],"outgoing":["53c31cee4a64d821","ed5ba7b91a54af72","da02033e6d596cae"]}